  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acceleariton of Rural Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strengthened a local institutional enabling environment for sustainable economic empowerment of women and young women 2. Improved income generation of rural women and young women in selected PDET areas through partnerships for women&apos;s economic empowerment and rural-urban linkages for value chains 3. Improved social and cultural awareness favorable to gender equality, including enhanced services for women, in selected municipalities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote economic and territorial development systems to overcome barriers to women economic empowerment and accelerate progress towards the targets of SDG5 in two PDETs regions of Colombia.&#x25a3; (&#xc131;&#xacfc;1) &#xc131; &#xc8fc;&#xb958;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc81c;&#xb3c4;&#xc801; &#xad6c;&#xcd95; &#xbc0f; &#xc815;&#xcc45;&#xc801; &#xc2e4;&#xd589;  
&#x25a3; (&#xc131;&#xacfc;2) &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xb18d;&#xcd0c; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xc758; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xc758; &#xc99d;&#xb300; 
&#x25a3; (&#xc131;&#xacfc;3) &#xc131;&#xd3c9;&#xb4f1;&#xc5d0; &#xc6b0;&#xd638;&#xc801;&#xc778; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xbb38;&#xd654;&#xc801; &#xc778;&#xc2dd;&#xc758; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
